(
    title: "Crayon Shin-chan 3: Ora no Gokigen Athletic",
    description: Some("Shinnosuke tours the neighbourhood by map screen, practising for his kindergarten\'s athletic meet: each minigame cleared hands over an item that opens a new route or gives him an edge on the day. Nine of them — tree-top water-pistol duels, tidying books in order, tag in the park, a tricycle race — then the meet itself, where you mash through hurdles, sand and a swim."),
